  vendorName: Importer Caldwell
  offerText: I need to hide these colossal crates of 'exotic spices' immediately.
    Store them in your quarters, and I will compensate you handsomely.
  acceptResultText: The heavy crates dominate your room. You pocket his fee, but
    nervously wonder what is actually inside them.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to hold his sketchy cargo. Breathing the clean air
    of your spacious room feels like a great decision.
  acceptedDelayedText: The crates contained illegal fireworks! One accidentally goes
    off, burning your hand, but you manage to sell the rest to a local gang for a
    massive profit!
